{"title":"Approach · Kormik","styles":"\n    .sc-placeholder{background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent);\n      border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden}\n    @keyframes sc-shine{0%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0% 50%}}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing{position:relative;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 5%,transparent);\n      border-color:transparent}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder::before,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing::before{content:'';\n      position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n      background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(217,119,87,0) 25%,rgba(247,225,211,.95) 37%,rgba(217,119,87,0) 63%);\n      background-size:400% 100%;animation:sc-shine 1.4s ease infinite}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-placeholder)::before,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-interp.sc-missing)::before{animation:none;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent)}\n    .sc-placeholder-error{padding:4px 8px;font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 70%,transparent);word-break:break-word}\n    .sc-interp.sc-missing{display:inline-block;width:2em;height:1em;overflow:hidden;\n      vertical-align:text-bottom;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;\n      user-select:none}\n    .sc-interp.sc-unresolved{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.85em;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 10%,transparent);border-radius:3px;\n      padding:0 3px}\n    .sc-host.sc-has-error{position:relative}\n    .sc-logic-error{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;z-index:2147483647;max-width:60ch;\n      padding:6px 10px;background:#b00020;color:#fff;font:12px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      border-radius:4px;white-space:pre-wrap;pointer-events:none}\n    /* Mirrors PRINT_BASELINE_CSS in apps/web deck-stage-export.ts — keep both\n       in sync until dc-runtime regains a build step. */\n    @media print {\n      @page { margin: 0.5cm; }\n      figure, table { break-inside: avoid; }\n      #dc-root, #dc-root > .sc-host { height: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after {\n        print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n        backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;\n        animation-delay: -99s !important; animation-duration: .001s !important;\n        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; animation-fill-mode: both !important;\n        animation-play-state: running !important; transition-duration: 0s !important;\n      }\n    }\n  \n/* ---- */\nx-dc{display:none!important}\n/* ---- */\nhtml,body{height:100%;margin:0}#dc-root,#dc-root>.sc-host{height:100%}\n/* ---- */\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n    body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); }\n    a { color: var(--indigo); text-decoration-color: var(--orange); }\n    a:hover { color: var(--indigo); }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) { .k-nav__menu, .k-lang__opt, .k-chip { min-height: 44px; } .k-btn--link { min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; } }\n  ","html":"<div class=\"sc-host\" data-sc-name=\"Approach\"><div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"12\" style=\"display: contents;\"><header class=\"k-nav\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"k-nav__inner\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__logo\"><img src=\"assets/logos/kormik-lockup-orange-indigo.png\" alt=\"Kormik\" height=\"40\"></a><nav class=\"k-nav__links\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Home</a><a href=\"Why it matters.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Why it matters</a><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">For clients</a><a href=\"Approach.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link is-active\" aria-current=\"page\">Approach</a><a href=\"About.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">About</a><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-nav__link\">Join</a></nav><div class=\"k-nav__end\"><div class=\"k-lang\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Language\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"k-lang__opt is-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">EN</button><button type=\"button\" lang=\"bn\" class=\"k-lang__opt\" aria-pressed=\"false\">বাং</button></div><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--sm\">Get early access</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"k-nav__menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Menu</button></div></div></header></div><main data-dc-tpl=\"13\"><section data-dc-tpl=\"14\" data-theme=\"indigo\" data-screen-label=\"Hero\" style=\"background: var(--indigo); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 88px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"15\" class=\"k-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 20px;\">\n    <p data-dc-tpl=\"16\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">Our approach</p>\n    <h1 data-dc-tpl=\"17\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 60px) / 1.05 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">We don't replace the old way. <span data-dc-tpl=\"18\" style=\"color: var(--orange);\">We give it a memory.</span></h1>\n    <p data-dc-tpl=\"19\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender); max-width: 60ch;\">Kormik starts from how work in Bangladesh already happens, and adds the one thing it has never had.</p>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"20\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Old way, Kormik way\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 72px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"21\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"22\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); grid-template-rows: repeat(5, auto); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"23\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; display: grid; grid-row: span 5; grid-template-rows: subgrid; row-gap: 14px; align-content: start;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"24\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">The old way</p>\n        <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"25\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(26px, 2.4vw, 34px) / 1.15 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8px; color: var(--indigo);\">Phone calls, cash, the sardar.</h2>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"26\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Fast and familiar. But when the day ends, it leaves no record.</p>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"27\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--slot);\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"28\" src=\"assets/work-crowd.jpg\" alt=\"Workers waiting to be picked for a day's work\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%; display: block;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"29\" style=\"background: var(--indigo); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; display: grid; grid-row: span 5; grid-template-rows: subgrid; row-gap: 14px; align-content: start;\">\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"30\" class=\"label\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">The Kormik way</p>\n        <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"31\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(26px, 2.4vw, 34px) / 1.15 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The same people, the same speed.</h2>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"32\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--lavender);\">Plus the one thing it never had: every day of work, on record, in the worker's own name.</p>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"33\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--indigo-2);\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"34\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/39325792/pexels-photo-39325792.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=900\" alt=\"A mason's hands laying bricks with mortar\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center center; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div data-dc-tpl=\"35\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"36\" src=\"assets/logos/kormik-mark-orange.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 28px; height: auto; display: block;\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"37\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 500 18px / 1.3 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">A record that's yours.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"38\" data-theme=\"orange\" data-screen-label=\"Promoted, not deleted\" style=\"background: var(--orange); color: var(--indigo); padding-block: 72px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"39\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"40\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 340px), 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px; align-items: center;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"41\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; min-width: 0px;\">\n        <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"42\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px) / 1.04 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.6px; color: var(--indigo);\">Promoted, not deleted.</h2>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"43\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Other platforms try to cut out the broker, and fail. The people who organise the work are how the work gets done.</p>\n        <p data-dc-tpl=\"44\" class=\"body-lg\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Kormik brings brokers and sardars in as Team Leaders. They keep their network, earn a name for reliable crews, and gain a future, such as growing into a licensed contractor.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"45\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--indigo); min-width: 0px; width: 100%;\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"46\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/19857796/pexels-photo-19857796.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=900\" alt=\"A crew working together on a bridge in Chilmari, Bangladesh\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center center; display: block;\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"47\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Building toward\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 72px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"48\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"49\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 40px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo); text-align: center;\">What we're building toward, for every worker</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"50\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 32px 40px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"51\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"52\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--orange);\"></span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"53\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Recognised</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"54\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Every day of work counted, in the worker's own name.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"55\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"56\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; background: var(--indigo);\"></span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"57\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Paid in full and on time</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"58\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">A record to stand on when the pay comes short.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"59\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"60\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; background: var(--orange); clip-path: polygon(50% 0px, 100% 100%, 0px 100%);\"></span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"61\" class=\"heading-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo);\">Protected</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"62\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Proof they were at work, on the day it counts.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"63\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Principles\" style=\"background: var(--paper); padding-block: 72px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"64\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"65\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 36px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo); text-align: center;\">Six principles</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"66\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 28px 40px;\">\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"67\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"68\" style=\"font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange-ink);\">01</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"69\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 22px;\">We listen first.</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"70\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">We start in the field, with the people who do the work.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"71\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"72\" style=\"font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange-ink);\">02</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"73\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 22px;\">Build on how work already happens.</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"74\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">The same calls, crews and places. Nothing to unlearn.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"75\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"76\" style=\"font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange-ink);\">03</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"77\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 22px;\">The record belongs to the worker.</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"78\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">It goes where they go, from job to job and year to year.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"79\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"80\" style=\"font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange-ink);\">04</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"81\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 22px;\">Fair to everyone on the job.</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"82\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">Workers, Team Leaders and clients each get something real.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"83\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"84\" style=\"font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange-ink);\">05</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"85\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 22px;\">Bangla first, built for basic phones.</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"86\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">If it doesn't work on the phone in a worker's pocket, it doesn't work.</p></div>\n      <div data-dc-tpl=\"87\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"88\" style=\"font: 700 15px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange-ink);\">06</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"89\" class=\"heading-4\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 22px;\">Honest at every step.</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"90\" class=\"body\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: var(--ink-muted);\">We say what is ready, what isn't, and what may change.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"91\" data-theme=\"indigo\" data-screen-label=\"What we will not do\" style=\"background: var(--indigo-deep); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 72px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"92\" class=\"k-container\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"93\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 32px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">What we will not do</h2>\n    <ul data-dc-tpl=\"94\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px 32px;\">\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"95\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); padding-top: 16px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"96\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font: 700 24px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">×</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"97\" style=\"font: 500 20px / 1.3 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Sell workers' data</span></li>\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"98\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); padding-top: 16px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"99\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font: 700 24px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">×</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"100\" style=\"font: 500 20px / 1.3 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Cut out the people who organise the work</span></li>\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"101\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); padding-top: 16px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"102\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font: 700 24px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">×</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"103\" style=\"font: 500 20px / 1.3 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Ask for more than we need</span></li>\n      <li data-dc-tpl=\"104\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); padding-top: 16px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"105\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font: 700 24px / 1 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: var(--orange);\">×</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"106\" style=\"font: 500 20px / 1.3 Ubuntu, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Pretend to be finished</span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"107\" data-theme=\"light\" data-screen-label=\"Next\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-block: 72px;\">\n  <div data-dc-tpl=\"108\" class=\"k-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 18px;\">\n    <h2 data-dc-tpl=\"109\" style=\"margin: 0px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px) / 1.1 Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--indigo);\">Be part of it from the start.</h2>\n    <div data-dc-tpl=\"110\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: center;\">\n      <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"111\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"Join.dc.html\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--md\">Join early access<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"112\" style=\"display: contents;\"><a href=\"About.dc.html#where-we-are\" class=\"k-btn k-btn--secondary k-btn--md\">Where we are<span class=\"k-btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div></section></main><div class=\"sc-host-x\" data-dc-tpl=\"113\" style=\"display: contents;\"><footer class=\"k-footer\" data-theme=\"indigo\"><div class=\"k-container\"><div class=\"k-footer__top\"><div class=\"k-footer__brand\"><img src=\"assets/logos/kormik-lockup-white.png\" alt=\"Kormik\" height=\"36\"><p class=\"k-footer__tag\">A record that's yours. Every day of informal work in Bangladesh, recognised, paid and protected.</p></div><nav class=\"k-footer__links\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"Home.dc.html\">Home</a><a href=\"Why it matters.dc.html\">Why it matters</a><a href=\"For clients.dc.html\">For clients</a><a href=\"Approach.dc.html\">Approach</a><a href=\"About.dc.html\">About</a><a href=\"Join.dc.html\">Join</a></nav></div><div class=\"k-footer__base\"><span>© 2026 Kormik · kormik.com.bd · Pre-launch preview, made in Dhaka. Not yet a live service.</span></div></div></footer></div></div>","links":["_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/fonts.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/icons.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/colors.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/typography.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/spacing.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/tokens/components.css","_ds/kormik-design-system-ae88bca0-d24a-43f7-ac25-8d943541474b/styles.css"]}